    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f348056ba4ac9763821ab9d7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──今天的Umatube直播，\n同时观看人数是历史最高，评价也很好喔……！\nUmatok的按赞率也相当高！",
      "source_fingerprint": "29861543fca3610dff668f5de02ab27d57b147d2773c4a9a8323bedd193a6269",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16c28e9e52e7d6c8621e78e7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……北港火山为了开拓在地偶像活动的范围，\n让知名度上升，在训练的空档\n充满活力地更新社交平台。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e945ee92ac28a876823ab13be64181fbe5114f865401b4c3a9726b8e0c92547a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43a979910ac0e3c3f959b61c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她为了充分活用Umatter、UG、Umatube，\n以及Umatok所做的努力，\n一点一滴踏实地结成硕果──",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e4266eefb9ab6365f9dbe3bbc62b82e15927912bf4d23c27e97112191c559c5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cde4091cc1bb081788d1703c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "和刚出道时相比，\n感觉已经累积了一定数量的固定粉丝。\n但她所做的努力不只这些。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b8efff8369e3c286abc94daaea31dddffe0e18dac020549e662a75030212cdb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61a77ee90ff29dc8d0816809",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──她也全力钻研累积沙土赛马娘的经验，\n为了能稳健地挑战大舞台，\n不断累积着实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "93e581a914af995f678b1e9c2780ff0713a5530f1bc87ee888f1b4ec3e20d4c2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2cc8ab4de701ecad3deaca9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "想身兼二职需要相当的劳力，\n但北港火山一直认真、\n稳扎稳打地走在这条路上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "81a43655ccaba8400919cdb13fb61350f578a1256b9871dbbf49ae524cd53bb6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cba1ae5c955c00fa3055421",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这段时间我再度感受到，\n这样真挚的态度，\n就是北港火山最大的武器──",
      "source_fingerprint": "f83986020d55b0678950afae5deebaf6199512bdcf981a08f1154921459f1910",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
