    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:663da79780289fc147a1ec7f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我今天和北港火山约好，\n在训练和在地偶像活动回顾完后，\n要一起看这个电视节目。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9288406137c476b7c056bf42ecbb4118ae965ba4d8b4dd07184097afbc6b7ca",
