      "uid": "zhcn:4c48a702ee878422f20a899f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──今年的沙土压轴战\n“东京大赏典”也迫在眉睫，\n该关注的果然是这名赛马娘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9673a0d99a97feaaca5c9a19e929cd8833470994636dad12c2aaea4a26086c8c",
